    "AboutDialog_Title": "About Safety Bowtie (MIL-STD-882E)",
    "AboutDialog_Message": "Renders a MIL-STD-882E safety bowtie: causal factors flow through preventive controls into the hazard (top event), then out through mitigative controls to mishaps. Bind severity and probability to colour nodes by assessed mishap risk (882E Table III). Click a node to cross-filter, double-click to drill, and use the legend to filter by element type or program."
